<title>GERMANY: Emirates ups to daily Dubai-Frankfurt flights.</title>
<headline>Emirates ups to daily Dubai-Frankfurt flights.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emirates said it will upgrade to daily services between Dubai and Frankfurt from April 1.</p>
<p>The United Arab Emirates national airline was increasing from six flights a week on the route due to high passenger demand, a statement said.</p>
<p>Emirates flies the route with an Airbus A310. --Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax+: 5017</p>
</text>
